# NOT ignored, deliberately:
#   datasets/  frozen input; plan metrics are reproducible against it, and
#              regenerating it changes every plan
#   schemas/   the contract other agents generate their types from, so it must be
#              readable without running Python
#   config/    weights are railway policy, and policy belongs in version control
